# React component structure

Project-owned function components must use this order:

1. States
2. Library hooks
3. Custom hooks
4. Constants
5. Functions
6. Effects
7. Return

Prefer `export default function ComponentName()`.

Hooks rules take priority. Do not add effects just to fill a section. Server Components stay server components.

Before creating or refactoring a component, follow `.cursor/skills/create-react-component/SKILL.md`.

The ESLint rule `react-component-structure/react-component-structure` flags order violations. Justified exceptions need a comment.
